        "eyebrow": "Who this is for",
        "heading": "Honest Guidance: <em>Is This Kit Right for You?</em>",
        "text": "The Foundation Kit is intended for people assessed as having Stage 1 or Stage 2 OSMF, where symptoms and functional changes may still be relatively early.",
        "yes_title": "This kit may be suitable to discuss if:",
        "yes_items": "A qualified healthcare professional has assessed you and considers your condition consistent with Stage 1 or Stage 2 OSMF.\nYou experience burning mainly when eating spicy or hot food.\nYou have early cheek sensitivity, mild tightness or a feeling that the inner cheek lining is less flexible.\nYou have noticed subtle changes in mouth opening, without assuming that this alone confirms OSMF or its stage.\nYou want a structured daily routine built around MARCEL OraCare Oral Spray and MARCEL Smile Toothpaste, as part of professionally guided care.",
        "no_title": "Consider getting guidance first if:",
        "no_items": "You have not been examined or are unsure whether your symptoms are due to OSMF. Arrange a professional assessment first.\nYour mouth opening is markedly restricted, cheek or tongue movement is significantly affected, or symptoms are progressing. Seek clinical review to find the right care pathway.\nYou are unsure whether the Foundation Kit is appropriate. Contact MARCEL Team for product information or request a teleconsultation with a MARCEL OSMF Consultant.\nYou have a persistent mouth ulcer, red or white patch, lump, unexplained bleeding or worsening symptoms. Seek prompt in-person examination rather than relying on a product kit.",
